00:45:10.340 --> 00:45:12.142
PASSED AWAY AT THE AGE OF 71

00:45:12.209 --> 00:45:13.577
AFTER A PROLONGED BATTLE WITH

00:45:13.644 --> 00:45:15.979
CANCER ON MAY 27TH, 2024, IN SAN

00:45:16.046 --> 00:45:19.083
DIEGO. WALTON WAS BORN AND

00:45:19.149 --> 00:45:20.317
RAISED IN LA MESA, CALIFORNIA,

00:45:20.384 --> 00:45:22.319
WITH THREE SIBLINGS, INCLUDING

00:45:22.386 --> 00:45:23.487
CATHY, ANDY AND BRUCE, WHO AT

00:45:23.554 --> 00:45:25.956
SIX, SIX AND 250 POUNDS, PLAYED

00:45:26.023 --> 00:45:28.192
SIDE BY SIDE WITH HIS YOUNGER

00:45:28.258 --> 00:45:29.993
SIX SEVEN LITTLE BROTHER BILL AT

00:45:30.060 --> 00:45:32.129
HELIX HIGH SCHOOL, BRUCE WENT ON

00:45:32.196 --> 00:45:33.997
TO PLAY FOR THE DALLAS COWBOYS.

00:45:34.064 --> 00:45:35.966
BRUCE AND BILL ARE THE ONLY

00:45:36.033 --> 00:45:38.235
BROTHER BROTHER COMBINATION IN

00:45:38.302 --> 00:45:39.369
HISTORY TO EVER PLAY IN THE

00:45:39.436 --> 00:45:41.605
SUPER BOWL AND TO WIN THE NBA

00:45:41.672 --> 00:45:42.606
CHAMPIONSHIP. BILL WALTON BECAME

00:45:42.673 --> 00:45:45.142
SYNONYMOUS WITH ATHLETICISM AND

00:45:45.209 --> 00:45:46.176
WAS TALENTED AT EVERYTHING HE

00:45:46.243 --> 00:45:48.812
DID, ACHIEVING SO MUCH SUCCESS

00:45:48.879 --> 00:45:50.614
CAME WITH INJURY WHILE STILL IN

00:45:50.681 --> 00:45:52.916
HIGH SCHOOL AT HELIX HIGH

00:45:52.983 --> 00:45:54.118
SCHOOL, HE BROKE AN ANKLE, A LEG

00:45:54.184 --> 00:45:56.453
AND SEVERAL BONES IN HIS FEET,

00:45:56.520 --> 00:45:57.588
AS WELL AS UNDERWENT KNEE

00:45:57.654 --> 00:45:58.922
SURGERY BEFORE HIS SOPHOMORE

00:45:58.989 --> 00:46:01.925
SEASON, WALTON UNDERWENT SURGERY

00:46:01.992 --> 00:46:03.160
TO REPAIR TORN CARTILAGE ON HIS

00:46:03.227 --> 00:46:05.529
LEFT KNEE. THESE EARLY INJURIES

00:46:05.596 --> 00:46:06.797
TOOK A TOLL ON BILL THROUGHOUT

00:46:06.864 --> 00:46:07.865
HIS COLLEGE AND PROFESSIONAL

00:46:07.931 --> 00:46:09.700
CAREERS, AND HE WOULD FREQUENTLY

00:46:09.766 --> 00:46:10.801
COMPLAIN ABOUT IT THROUGHOUT HIS

00:46:10.868 --> 00:46:12.836
LIFE. HE WOULD FREQUENTLY

00:46:12.903 --> 00:46:14.605
COMPLAIN ABOUT IT TO ME WHEN I

00:46:14.671 --> 00:46:16.673
SPOKE TO HIM LATER IN LIFE, NOT

00:46:16.740 --> 00:46:17.908
EARLY IN HIS LIFE. THROUGHOUT

00:46:17.975 --> 00:46:18.976
HIS LIFE, WALTON CARRIED A

00:46:19.042 --> 00:46:20.978
POSITIVE ATTITUDE AND AT ONE

00:46:21.044 --> 00:46:22.346
POINT SAID, I'VE HAD 36

00:46:22.412 --> 00:46:23.881
ORTHOPEDIC OPERATIONS WITH TWO

00:46:23.947 --> 00:46:25.048
FUZED ANKLES. MY KNEES, HANDS

00:46:25.115 --> 00:46:27.551
AND WRISTS DON'T WORK. I NOW

00:46:27.618 --> 00:46:29.386
HAVE A FUZED SPINE. OTHER THAN

00:46:29.453 --> 00:46:30.854
THAT, EVERYTHING IS GREAT.

00:46:30.921 --> 00:46:32.689
WALTON WENT ON TO BECOME A

00:46:32.756 --> 00:46:34.324
LARGER THAN LIFE FIGURE, ONLY

00:46:34.391 --> 00:46:36.493
PARTLY DUE TO HIS NEARLY SEVEN

00:46:36.560 --> 00:46:37.594
FOOT FRAME. WALTON'S UNIQUE ALL

00:46:37.661 --> 00:46:39.630
AROUND SKILLS MADE HIM A

00:46:39.696 --> 00:46:40.797
DOMINANT PLAYER AT UCLA UNDER

00:46:40.864 --> 00:46:43.133
COACH JOHN WOODEN. FROM 1971 TO

00:46:43.200 --> 00:46:46.403
1974, HE LED THE UNBEATABLE

00:46:46.470 --> 00:46:49.473
BRUINS TO TWO NCAA CHAMPIONSHIPS

00:46:49.540 --> 00:46:50.474
AND REMAINED LIFELONG FRIENDS

00:46:50.541 --> 00:46:52.843
WITH WOODEN. WALTON THEN LED TWO

00:46:52.910 --> 00:46:54.444
NBA TEAMS TO CHAMPIONSHIPS. IN

00:46:54.511 --> 00:46:56.146
1977, HE LED THE PORTLAND TRAIL

00:46:56.213 --> 00:46:58.348
BLAZERS TO VICTORY AGAINST THE

00:46:58.415 --> 00:47:00.117
HEAVILY FAVORED PHILADELPHIA 76

00:47:00.184 --> 00:47:01.818
ERS AND WAS NAMED MVP. FOLLOWING

00:47:01.885 --> 00:47:04.121
THE SERIES, THE 76 SIXERS COACH

00:47:04.188 --> 00:47:06.490
SAID BILL WALTON IS THE BEST

00:47:06.557 --> 00:47:08.425
PLAYER FOR A BIG MAN WHO HAS

00:47:08.492 --> 00:47:09.493
EVER PLAYED THE GAME OF

00:47:09.560 --> 00:47:10.994
BASKETBALL. AFTER A SHORT LIVED

00:47:11.061 --> 00:47:12.095
STINT WITH THE SAN DIEGO

00:47:12.162 --> 00:47:13.330
CLIPPERS, WALTON JOINED THE

00:47:13.397 --> 00:47:15.132
BOSTON CELTICS, WHERE HE LED HIS

00:47:15.199 --> 00:47:16.900
TEAM TO AN NBA CHAMPIONSHIP IN

00:47:16.967 --> 00:47:18.101
1986. ALMOST TEN YEARS LATER, HE

00:47:18.168 --> 00:47:20.237
BECAME THE ONLY PLAYER TO HAVE

00:47:20.304 --> 00:47:22.639
WON AN NBA FINALS MVP, SIX MAN

00:47:22.706 --> 00:47:25.809
AWARD, AND REGULAR SEASON MVP.

00:47:25.876 --> 00:47:27.044
IN 1993, HE WAS ENSHRINED INTO

00:47:27.110 --> 00:47:29.646
THE BASKETBALL HALL OF FAME.

00:47:29.713 --> 00:47:31.448
NOBODY WOULD HAVE GUESSED THAT

00:47:31.515 --> 00:47:32.783
WALTON HAD BEEN A SHY YOUNG MAN

00:47:32.849 --> 00:47:33.917
AND OVERCAME A LIFELONG STUTTER

00:47:33.984 --> 00:47:35.986
WHEN HE EMBARKED ON HIS NEXT

00:47:36.053 --> 00:47:37.788
SUCCESSFUL CAREER AS A SPORTS

00:47:37.854 --> 00:47:39.723
BROADCASTER FOR OVER 20 YEARS,

00:47:39.790 --> 00:47:41.458
HE WORKED FOR NATIONAL NETWORKS

00:47:41.525 --> 00:47:43.327
AND NBA TEAMS. HE ENTERTAINED

00:47:43.393 --> 00:47:44.294
AUDIENCES WITH HIS COLORFUL

00:47:44.361 --> 00:47:46.296
COMMENTARY THAT INCLUDED

00:47:46.363 --> 00:47:47.364
REFERENCES FROM THE CLASSICS AND

00:47:47.431 --> 00:47:49.600
POETRY TO POP CULTURE AND

00:47:49.666 --> 00:47:50.667
PHILOSOPHY. IN 2001, WALTON

00:47:50.734 --> 00:47:53.704
RECEIVED AN EMMY AWARD FOR BEST

00:47:53.770 --> 00:47:56.340
LIVE SPORTS TELEVISION BROADCAST

00:47:56.406 --> 00:47:57.474
. IN TWO 2018, HE WON THE

00:47:57.541 --> 00:47:59.843
COLLEGE SPORTS INFORMATION

00:47:59.910 --> 00:48:00.978
DIRECTORS OF AMERICA DICK ENBERG

00:48:01.044 --> 00:48:04.114
AWARD. ASIDE FROM BEING A

00:48:04.181 --> 00:48:05.115
NATIONAL CHAMPION AND AWARD

00:48:05.182 --> 00:48:06.984
WINNING SPORTSCASTER FOR YEARS,

00:48:07.050 --> 00:48:08.151
BILL WALTON WAS AN ENTHUSIASTIC

00:48:08.218 --> 00:48:10.520
CITY OF SAN DIEGO BOOSTER, A

00:48:10.587 --> 00:48:11.555
TRUE EVANGELIST FOR THE GREAT

00:48:11.622 --> 00:48:14.858
CITY AND COUNTY OF SAN DIEGO. IN

00:48:14.925 --> 00:48:17.094
HIS FINAL YEARS, HE FOCUSED THE

00:48:17.160 --> 00:48:18.295
MAJORITY OF HIS ATTENTION ON THE

00:48:18.362 --> 00:48:19.363
CITY'S GROWING HOMELESSNESS

00:48:19.429 --> 00:48:20.831
PROBLEM, CHALLENGING LEADERS TO

00:48:20.897 --> 00:48:23.800
BE MORE EFFECTIVE. BILL WALTON

00:48:23.867 --> 00:48:25.068
WAS ALSO THE FATHER OF FOUR SONS

00:48:25.135 --> 00:48:27.037
WHO CARRY HIS SON'S GENES OF

00:48:27.104 --> 00:48:28.071
BEING VERY TALENTED AND VERY

00:48:28.138 --> 00:48:30.540
TALL. HIS SON, LUKE WAS AN NBA

00:48:30.607 --> 00:48:32.843
PLAYER, WINNING BOTH THE 2009

00:48:32.909 --> 00:48:34.011
AND 2010 NBA FINALS WITH THE

00:48:34.077 --> 00:48:36.446
LAKERS. HE WAS HEAD COACH OF THE

00:48:36.513 --> 00:48:39.216
SACRAMENTO KINGS FROM 2019 TO

00:48:39.283 --> 00:48:41.051
2021. DURING THE HEART OF THE

00:48:41.118 --> 00:48:42.819
COVID PANDEMIC. MY OWN LIFE

00:48:42.886 --> 00:48:43.887
INTERSECTED WITH BILL WALTON'S

00:48:43.954 --> 00:48:46.089
SON ADAM, WHERE WE BOTH ATTENDED

00:48:46.156 --> 00:48:47.924
THE SAME HIGH SCHOOL AT THE SAME

00:48:47.991 --> 00:48:49.126
TIME. WHEN I WAS MVP OF THE

00:48:49.192 --> 00:48:50.294
TORREY PINES HIGH SCHOOL

00:48:50.360 --> 00:48:52.195
BASKETBALL GIRLS TEAM, ADAM WAS

00:48:52.262 --> 00:48:53.363
A TOWERING STAR ON THE TORREY

00:48:53.430 --> 00:48:55.532
PINES HIGH SCHOOL BOYS TEAM.

