NATHAN AND ADAM AND CHRIS ALL

00:48:56.733 --> 00:48:59.202
PLAYED FOR VARIOUS COLLEGES AND

00:48:59.269 --> 00:49:00.170
UNIVERSITIES AND WENT ON TO

00:49:00.237 --> 00:49:02.906
SUCCESSFUL CAREERS. BILL WALTON

00:49:02.973 --> 00:49:04.007
IS SURVIVED BY HIS SONS AND

00:49:04.074 --> 00:49:05.842
THEIR FAMILIES, AS WELL AS HIS

00:49:05.909 --> 00:49:06.977
WIFE, LORI MATSUOKA, ONE LITTLE

00:49:07.044 --> 00:49:09.713
KNOWN BUT CHERISHED ASPECT OF

00:49:09.780 --> 00:49:10.714
WALTON'S PERSONAL LIFE THAT

00:49:10.781 --> 00:49:12.649
GIVES US A WINDOW INTO HIS SOUL

