WAS HIS LOVE FOR MUSIC. ONE BAND

00:49:14.751 --> 00:49:15.886
IN PARTICULAR WAS VERY DEAR TO

00:49:15.952 --> 00:49:18.055
HIM, AS HE PUT IT, THE GRATEFUL

00:49:18.121 --> 00:49:19.356
DEAD. THEY ARE MY BEST FRIENDS.

00:49:19.423 --> 00:49:21.191
THEIR MESSAGE OF HOPE, PEACE,

00:49:21.258 --> 00:49:22.726
LOVE, TEAMWORK, CREATIVITY,

00:49:22.793 --> 00:49:26.063
IMAGINATION, CELEBRATION, DANCE,

00:49:26.129 --> 00:49:27.030
VISION, PURPOSE, THE PASSION,

00:49:27.097 --> 00:49:28.298
ALL OF THE THINGS THAT I BELIEVE

00:49:28.365 --> 00:49:30.233
IN MAKES ME THE LUCKIEST

00:49:30.300 --> 00:49:32.569
DEADHEAD IN THE WORLD. WALTON

00:49:32.636 --> 00:49:33.637
WILL ALWAYS BE REMEMBERED FOR

00:49:33.704 --> 00:49:34.571
HIS EXTRAORDINARY CAREER.

