TOWERING HEIGHT AND LARGER THAN

00:49:36.273 --> 00:49:37.941
LIFE PERSONALITY IN SAN DIEGO

00:49:38.008 --> 00:49:40.110
WILL ALSO BE REMEMBERED AS A

00:49:40.177 --> 00:49:41.278
BELOVED AND GENEROUS NATIVE SON

00:49:41.345 --> 00:49:43.780
AND WITH THAT, I ASK THAT WE

00:49:43.847 --> 00:49:44.881
ADJOURN THE SENATE IN HIS

00:49:44.948 --> 00:49:46.016
MEMORY. THANK YOU, SENATOR

00:49:46.083 --> 00:49:47.284
UMBERG. THANK YOU COLLEAGUES.

00:49:47.351 --> 00:49:50.454
MADAM PRESIDENT, AND THANK YOU

00:49:50.520 --> 00:49:51.621
TO MY COLLEAGUE FROM ENCINITAS

00:49:51.688 --> 00:49:52.989
FOR BRINGING THIS ADJOURNMENT

00:49:53.056 --> 00:49:56.593
FORWARD, BILL WALTON WAS A

00:49:56.660 --> 00:49:57.794
LEGEND, NOT JUST AT UCLA, BUT

00:49:57.861 --> 00:50:00.430
ALL OVER CALIFORNIA, ALL OVER

00:50:00.497 --> 00:50:02.366
THE WORLD, IN FACT. AND I KNOW

00:50:02.432 --> 00:50:03.500
DESPITE MY YOUTHFUL APPEARANCE,

00:50:03.567 --> 00:50:04.634
IT DOESN'T SEEM POSSIBLE THAT I

00:50:04.701 --> 00:50:06.770
COULD HAVE BEEN AT UCLA DURING

00:50:06.837 --> 00:50:07.838
THE 70S. BUT INDEED, I WAS

00:50:07.904 --> 00:50:10.440
DURING THE WOODEN AND WALTON

00:50:10.507 --> 00:50:13.443
ERA, BILL WALTON, I GOT A CHANCE

00:50:13.510 --> 00:50:14.678
TO KNOW HIM THROUGH VARIOUS UCLA

00:50:14.745 --> 00:50:17.013
ACTIVITIES, AND HE WAS TRULY ONE

00:50:17.080 --> 00:50:20.283
OF A KIND. BESIDES HIS ATHLETIC

00:50:20.350 --> 00:50:23.653
PROWESS, HIS ENGAGEMENT IN THE

00:50:23.720 --> 00:50:26.790
COMMUNITY WAS FANTASTIC. IN

00:50:26.857 --> 00:50:27.791
EVERY ISSUE, FROM HOMELESSNESS

00:50:27.858 --> 00:50:28.892
TO THE ENVIRONMENT. HE WAS A

00:50:28.959 --> 00:50:30.694
TREMENDOUS ENVIRONMENTALIST. HE

00:50:30.761 --> 00:50:33.764
ALSO KNEW MORE USELESS STUFF

00:50:33.830 --> 00:50:34.998
THAN ANY OTHER HUMAN BEING I'VE

00:50:35.065 --> 00:50:36.666
EVER ENCOUNTERED, AND WAS QUITE

00:50:36.733 --> 00:50:38.468
PROUD OF ALL THE USELESS

00:50:38.535 --> 00:50:40.470
INFORMATION HE COULD PROVIDE TO

00:50:40.537 --> 00:50:41.438
YOU, THERE'S A RECENT

00:50:41.505 --> 00:50:44.708
DOCUMENTARY ON ESPN CALLED THE

00:50:44.775 --> 00:50:46.943
LUCKIEST GUY IN THE WORLD, AND I

00:50:47.010 --> 00:50:48.145
ENCOURAGE ALL OF YOU TO SEE IT

00:50:48.211 --> 00:50:49.179
BECAUSE IT IS REALLY

00:50:49.246 --> 00:50:51.615
INSPIRATIONAL, WE JOIN WITH HIS

00:50:51.681 --> 00:50:54.785
FAMILY WITH LORI AND ADAM AND

00:50:54.851 --> 00:50:57.721
NATHAN, LUKE AND CHRIS AND HIS

00:50:57.788 --> 00:50:58.755
THREE GRANDCHILDREN, OLIVIA,

00:50:58.822 --> 00:51:01.258
AVERY, ROSE AND CHASE AND

00:51:01.324 --> 00:51:02.392
MOURNING HIS LOSS. IT'S A LOSS

00:51:02.459 --> 00:51:04.895
FOR ALL OF US. AND I ASK THAT WE

00:51:04.961 --> 00:51:06.196
JOIN MY COLLEAGUE FROM ENCINITAS

00:51:06.263 --> 00:51:09.099
TO ADJOURN IN HIS MEMORY. THANK

00:51:09.166 --> 00:51:11.301
YOU. SENATOR. SENATOR BIXBY,

00:51:11.368 --> 00:51:12.469
PLEASE BRING THE HALL OF FAMER'S

00:51:12.536 --> 00:51:14.337
NAME FORWARD SO THAT HE MAY BE

00:51:14.404 --> 00:51:14.938
PROPERLY MEMORIALIZED IN THE

00:51:15.005 --> 00:51:16.006
JOURNAL. IF THERE'S NO OTHER

00:51:16.072 --> 00:51:18.041
BUSINESS CENTER. GROVE, THE DESK

00:51:18.108 --> 00:51:19.142
IS CLEAR, THANK YOU, MADAM

00:51:19.209 --> 00:51:21.378
PRESIDENT. I BELIEVE THAT WE

00:51:21.445 --> 00:51:23.313
WILL BE IN RECESS UNTIL 330, AT

00:51:23.380 --> 00:51:25.615
WHICH TIME A MOTION WILL BE MADE

00:51:25.682 --> 00:51:26.683
FOR ADJOURNMENT. WE RECONVENE

00:51:26.750 --> 00:51:28.151
COLLEAGUES ON THURSDAY, JUNE

00:51:28.218 --> 00:51:31.354
13TH, 2024 AT 9 A.M. THE SENATE

00:51:31.421 --> 00:51:33.690
WILL BE IN RECESS UNTIL 3:30

00:51:33.757 --> 00:51:34.758
P.M, AT WHICH TIME THE

00:51:34.825 --> 00:51:37.060
ADJOURNMENT MOTION WILL BE MADE.

00:51:37.127 --> 00:51:38.161
WE WILL RECONVENE THURSDAY, JUNE

00:51:38.228 --> 00:51:56.913
13TH AT 9 A.M.


